    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure in procedural generated regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions in encounters and embrace the corresponding outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your units on a chessboard-like battlefield and battle with all kinds of opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit legendary units, obtain rare artifacts, and learn powerful spells. Your strength will be defined by yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One victory doesn't mean the end of the journey. There are still more gameplay and challenges to unlock.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contents</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 factions with different units, specialties and commanders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ unit cards, the vast majority of which can be recruited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ spells that can be learned and cast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ items that can be obtained and equipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ random events, distributed in 4 different regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in Early Access and will be continuously updated with more content added!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure in procedural generated regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions in encounters and embrace the corresponding outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your units on a chessboard-like battlefield and battle with all kinds of opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit legendary units, obtain rare artifacts, and learn powerful spells. Your strength will be defined by yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One victory doesn't mean the end of the journey. There are still more gameplay and challenges to unlock.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contents</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 factions with different units, specialties and commanders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ unit cards, the vast majority of which can be recruited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ spells that can be learned and cast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ items that can be obtained and equipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ random events, distributed in 4 different regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in Early Access and will be continuously updated with more content added!</p></li></ul>",
